[00:00.00]Lyrics: wiobr
[00:01.00]Music: wiobr
[00:04.00]Cold lights
[00:08.50]Blue shadows
[00:13.00]Your voice inside my head tonight
[00:21.00][Verse 1]
[00:24.00]Running through the empty streets alone
[00:31.00]Neon rain is falling on my soul
[00:38.00]Every message left me feeling numb
[00:45.00]But I still wait for you to come
[00:53.00]Your silhouette inside the dark
[00:59.00]Like a fire leaving hidden scars
[01:06.00]I know we’re broken from the start
[01:13.00]Still I can’t escape your heart
[01:21.00][Pre-Chorus]
[01:24.00]Every time you pull me close
[01:30.00]I lose control again
[01:35.00]And every lie becomes the truth
[01:41.00]Inside this midnight haze
[01:48.00][Chorus]
[01:51.00]Turn the lights off
[01:55.00]Let the silence take me over
[02:02.00]Heartbeat echoes in the dark
[02:08.00]Like we’re crashing into stars
[02:16.00]Turn the lights off
[02:20.00]I don’t wanna see us fading
[02:27.00]Hold me like the world might end
[02:34.00]Tonight we lose ourselves again
[02:42.00][Drop]
[02:45.00]Oh-oh-oh
[02:49.00]Lost inside the neon glow
[02:55.00]Oh-oh-oh
[02:59.00]Never let me go
[03:07.00][Verse 2]
[03:10.00]City smoke and flashing traffic lights
[03:17.00]Your reflection disappears at night
[03:24.00]Every touch feels dangerous and sweet
[03:31.00]Like poison dancing underneath
[03:40.00][Bridge]
[03:43.00]If tomorrow comes too fast
[03:49.00]Promise this will always last
[03:55.00]Even if we fall apart
[04:01.00]You’ll still be inside my heart
[04:10.00][Final Chorus]
[04:13.00]Turn the lights off
[04:17.00]Let the darkness pull us closer
[04:24.00]Burning like electric scars
[04:30.00]Falling through these shattered stars
[04:38.00]Turn the lights off
[04:42.00]Even if the night consumes us
[04:49.00]For a moment we were free
[04:55.00]That’s enough for you and me
[05:04.00][Outro]
[05:07.00]Cold lights
[05:11.00]Blue shadows
[05:16.00]Your voice still lives inside my soul